# 魔導巧殻's 設定 (docs/engine-re.md, "4.43B's shell and settings"): at the title the `option` steps set
# controls on each page, each through its menu command and OK. Natively AGERC's dialog, on the port the options panel.
# AGE 4.43B's shell is 4.38D's: the same menu 110, bar and pages, so the same option names.
#
# - The first `options` lists the sandbox's values. 音声終了まで待つ is on (message:AutoMessageOption=0), which
#   disables the voice group's 文字単位時間, so auto-pitch-voice is not listed until the check is off.
# - The last `options` lists what was set, the same on both targets.
#
# Compare SYS4REG.INI after `stop` on both targets. Beside what is set here, it holds message:MessageFade=250 after
# MessageSpeed: SYSTEM4's op 0x2ee set it, and 4.43B binds the key there. On a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game koukaku native|port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game koukaku native|port run tools/drive/scenarios/koukaku-options.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game koukaku native|port stop

rand-seed 13
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=120
settle timeout=20

options                                 # the sandbox's values
option auto-wait-voice-end off          # 音声終了まで待つ off enables the voice group's 文字単位時間
option auto-pitch-voice 230
option auto-wait-voice 900
option auto-pitch-text 370
option auto-wait-text 1200
option message-speed 30                 # the ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page
option wheel-advance on
option se-volume 7000                   # the ｻｳﾝﾄﾞ page
option lower-bgm-level 30
option effect-skip on                   # the その他 page
wait 1
options                                 # the values set above
expect script=TITLE
shot koukaku-options
